/forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-17T21:58:10-08:00","id":1289091,"title":"","content":"Great work Gone, these are beautiful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11567-jairain","name":"Jairain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11567_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"345"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-18T00:19:21-08:00","id":1289124,"title":"","content":"Fantastic work as always, and a lot of these will be insanely useful at the table too!<br /> <br /> Curious, I did notice you didn't include sheets for the Banu Haqim, The Ministry, or Lasombra, was there a particular reason for that?<br /> <br /> I suspect it is because The Ministry seems to be missing their Clan Symbol in the Anarch Guide (though they do get a nice custom font for their Clan at least, and one might argue the symbol featured on the necklace in the photo for the Clan might be the updated Clan symbol), and the Lasombra haven't been released in a way for us to see what the custom font for the Clan might be. However, the Banu Haqim have both their font (though it does honestly feel like a generic one was used in the Camarilla Guide) and symbol for V5 out - so they could probably get a sheet workup at least.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">-Red</span></b> V5 Fan Content: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1259556-v5-the-masquerade\" target=\"_blank\">The Masquerade</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1256114-v5-tzimisce-and-vicissitude\" target=\"_blank\">Tzimisce and Vicissitude</a> (non Program take), <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1253331-loresheets-chicago\" target=\"_blank\">Loresheet: Chicago</a> (pre CbN V5), <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1251576-v5-resonance-flavor\" target=\"_blank\">Resonance Flavor</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1291918-v5-morality\" target=\"_blank\">Morality System</a> Project Manager, Developer, Community Outreach at <a href=\"https://www.huntersentertainment.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Entertainment</a>","edited":{"userid":6164,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6164-red-eye","user":"Red Eye","date":". 02-18-2019, 12:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6164-red-eye","name":"Red Eye","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6164_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"210"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-18T12:12:43-08:00","id":1289263,"title":"","content":"Mr Gone, are you ok with these being used/distributed by people who are doing streamed games, possibly as a for profit endeavour?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25038-tubect","name":"Tubect","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-18T13:47:34-08:00","id":1289298,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jairain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1288974-vampire-5th-edition-character-sheets?p=1289091#post1289091\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Great work Gone, these are beautiful.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks!! I'm glad you liked em! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Red Eye</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1288974-vampire-5th-edition-character-sheets?p=1289124#post1289124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fantastic work as always, and a lot of these will be insanely useful at the table too!</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks!! I was hoping you'd like em...<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Red Eye</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1288974-vampire-5th-edition-character-sheets?p=1289124#post1289124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Curious, I did notice you didn't include sheets for the Banu Haqim, The Ministry, or Lasombra, was there a particular reason for that?<br /> <br /> I suspect it is because The Ministry seems to be missing their Clan Symbol in the Anarch Guide (though they do get a nice custom font for their Clan at least, and one might argue the symbol featured on the necklace in the photo for the Clan might be the updated Clan symbol), and the Lasombra haven't been released in a way for us to see what the custom font for the Clan might be. However, the Banu Haqim have both their font (though it does honestly feel like a generic one was used in the Camarilla Guide) and symbol for V5 out - so they could probably get a sheet workup at least.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea... I wasn't sure on the Banu Haqim. I'd had someone send the symbol and what was maybe the name logo, but I wasn't sure... and with the books having not been totally released, I wasn't sure. I didn't know The Ministry had a logo yet. And I knew the Lasombra weren't technically released yet.<br /> <br /> So, I figured I'd wait until those books were fully released(or close to it) and then I'd work up some sheers for them.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tubect</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1288974-vampire-5th-edition-character-sheets?p=1289263#post1289263\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mr Gone, are you ok with these being used/distributed by people who are doing streamed games, possibly as a for profit endeavour?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure, I don't think I'd have an issue with that. I made em for people use them in their games, so I don't see they couldn't be used in that way. I'd be fine with it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-10T18:06:58-07:00","id":1295703,"title":"","content":"Hey everyone! Just so you know... Per a Patreon request, I now have V5 sheets in the style of Vampire the Requiem! Here are the links:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/1e5i91xx2c5lpbv/Vampire_5thEdition_Requiem_2-Page_Interactive.pdf?dl=1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"j