_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>thebiglarpnerd</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1288974-vampire-5th-edition-character-sheets?p=1296278#post1296278\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There was a more or less 'official' image, sourced from Jason Carl's LA by Night game, for the Ministry. <a href=\"https://vignette.wikia.nocookie.net/whitewolf/images/3/38/SymbolClanMinistryV5.png/revision/latest?cb=20181205110812\" target=\"_blank\">https://vignette.wikia.nocookie.net/...20181205110812</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Oh cool, thanks! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I just need to hunt down the name logo(or the font used for it) and I'll be in business.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>maxmcgloin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1288974-vampire-5th-edition-character-sheets?p=1296811#post1296811\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">These are great! I love this new sheet.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! Glad you liked it!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>maxmcgloin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1288974-vampire-5th-edition-character-sheets?p=1296811#post1296811\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any chance we get the sixth line under Chronicle Tenants, Touchstones &amp; Convictions, and Clan Bane back?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not sure. I ran into a strange issue with the divider graphic from the Requiem sheet, and for some reason I couldn't get it to shrink properly(it kept crashing Photoshop when editing it). So, since it was a little wider than I needed, I had to make up the room in that section by removing that 6th line.<br /> <br /> If I can ever figure out a way to shrink that graphic a bit, I'll add that line back...<br /> <br /> And yea, it sounds crazy that I couldn't shrink it. I tried for at least an hour, I have no idea what the deal was with it...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-14T17:40:36-07:00","id":1296838,