le":"","content":"Hi everyone! I just wanted to let you know that I have alternate versions of the V5 sheets with an update to the backgrounds section.<br /> <br /> I had a Patron reach out to me with an idea to make a change to the background section, to make the top line just a blank line, and to add dots to the 8 lines under it. His reading on backgrounds is that they all work a little like Haven, where you'd have sub-backgrounds for each thing you list in that section.<br /> <br /> He thought that was the intention of Backgrounds, but I'm not sure I read it that way. I mean I know Haven works like that, but would most of the other backgrounds work in that same way? I wasn't totally sure. Granted, I don't know much about this version, so I might be totally wrong.<br /> <br /> My idea with that section when I made it was that you'd list your background and rating, and then have a spot where you could write some detail about the background, like a combination of the Backgrounds and Expanded Backgrounds from my previous Vampire sheets.<br /> <br /> Anyway, this still seemed like an interesting idea, and I like to give people options, so I made a version of both the Classic and Minimalist design with that layout.<br /> <br /> <br /> Here are the links:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/z2efkn41g783s6p/Vampire_5thEdition_Minimalist_AltBackgrounds_4-Page_Interactive.pdf?dl=1\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/z2efkn41g7...ctive.pdf?dl=1</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/qbqjz2izykir0oc/Vampire_5thEdition_Classic_AltBackgrounds_4-Page_Interactive.pdf?dl=1\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/qbqjz2izyk...ctive.pdf?dl=1</a><br /> <br /> Hope you like em!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and su