on! When I visited the Darkness Emergent event last year, a kind soul gave me the idea to do a foldable character sheet. I've been working on this on and off for about a year between projects, but was never super happy with the layout. But, I finally had a week or so to really concentrate on it, and I think I finally made something usable! There aren't a lot of dots on the sheets, as I thought it might be more useful to just write in the numbers for this kind of sheet, so hopefully that works ok.<br /> <br /> <br /> So, if you play Laws of the Night, I hope you get some good use out of this should you get the chance to use it!<br /> <br /> <br /> You can download the new sheet in the By Night Studios section of my site here: <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/wod.html#met\" target=\"_blank\">https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/wod.html#met</a><br /> <br /> <br /> Here is a direct link should you need it: <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/MET/METBNS/V5/Vampire_5thEdition_LawsOfTheNight_Mini_Foldable.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/MET/METBNS/V5/Vampire_5thEdition_LawsOfTheNight_Mini_Foldable.pd f</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":24,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","user":"Mr Gone","date":". 08-22-2025, 02:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/a